- **[MEDIUM]** `native_remainder` marks allocation/accounting/cancellation/process containment collectively `existing`, while its responsibility states that cancellation and process containment have no established in-tree mechanism. Split existing mechanisms from `later-qualified` responsibilities.
- **[INFO]** Otherwise, all six §10.2 responsibilities have intended Sley owners; every §10.3 remainder is mapped; §10.4 exclusions, the §10.2(6) discharge carve-out, RW-070 ABI freeze, and proposed-versus-implemented import distinction are retained. The converter's program-awareness prohibitions are appropriately explicit.

